<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<meta name="description" content="Hasbal Digital Creative Studio — freelance graphic design. Browse services and book a design session.">
<title>Hasbal Digital Creative Studio — Graphic Design &amp; Booking</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Bricolage+Grotesque:opsz,wght@12..96,200..800&family=IBM+Plex+Sans:wght@400;500;600&family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root{
    --paper:#FAF9F6;
    --paper-mist:#ECEAE2;
    --ink:#17181A;
    --ink-soft:#55564F;
    --cobalt:#2F3EFF;
    --cobalt-deep:#1D28C9;
    --coral:#FF5A5F;
    --sunbeam:#FFC83D;
    --line:rgba(23,24,26,0.14);
    --radius-sm:4px;
    --radius-md:12px;
    --font-display:'Bricolage Grotesque', sans-serif;
    --font-body:'IBM Plex Sans', sans-serif;
    --font-mono:'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
    --maxw:1180px;
  }
  *{box-sizing:border-box;}
  html{scroll-behavior:smooth;}
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce){
    html{scroll-behavior:auto;}
    *{animation-duration:0.001ms !important; animation-iteration-count:1 !important; transition-duration:0.001ms !important;}
  }
  body{
    margin:0;
    background:var(--paper);
    color:var(--ink);
    font-family:var(--font-body);
    font-size:16px;
    line-height:1.6;
    -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;
  }
  h1,h2,h3{
    font-family:var(--font-display);
    font-weight:800;
    line-height:1.05;
    margin:0;
    letter-spacing:-0.01em;
  }
  p{margin:0;}
  a{color:inherit;}
  .wrap{max-width:var(--maxw); margin:0 auto; padding:0 32px;}
  section{padding:120px 0;}
  @media (max-width:720px){ section{padding:72px 0;} .wrap{padding:0 20px;} }

  :focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--cobalt); outline-offset:3px;}

  .btn{
    display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:8px;
    font-family:var(--font-body); font-weight:600; font-size:0.95rem;
    padding:14px 26px; border-radius:var(--radius-sm);
    border:2px solid var(--ink); cursor:pointer;
    text-decoration:none; background:none; color:var(--ink);
    transition:transform .15s ease, background .15s ease, color .15s ease;
  }
  .btn:hover{transform:translateY(-2px);}
  .btn-primary{background:var(--ink); color:var(--paper);}
  .btn-primary:hover{background:var(--cobalt-deep); border-color:var(--cobalt-deep);}
  .btn-ghost:hover{background:var(--ink); color:var(--paper);}
  .btn:disabled{opacity:0.4; cursor:not-allowed; transform:none;}

  .tag{
    display:inline-block; font-size:0.78rem; font-weight:600;
    padding:4px 10px; border-radius:3px; background:var(--coral); color:var(--ink);
  }

  /* ---------- NAV ---------- */
  .site-nav{
    position:sticky; top:0; z-index:40;
    background:rgba(250,249,246,0.88); backdrop-filter:blur(8px);
    border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .nav-inner{
    max-width:var(--maxw); margin:0 auto; padding:18px 32px;
    display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between;
  }
  .brand{font-family:var(--font-display); font-weight:800; font-size:clamp(0.95rem, 2.6vw, 1.25rem); line-height:1.15; text-decoration:none; color:var(--ink);}
  .nav-links{display:flex; align-items:center; gap:30px;}
  .nav-links a{text-decoration:none; font-size:0.95rem; font-weight:500;}
  .nav-links a:not(.nav-cta):hover{color:var(--cobalt-deep);}
  .nav-cta{border:2px solid var(--ink); padding:9px 18px; border-radius:var(--radius-sm); font-weight:600;}
  .nav-cta:hover{background:var(--ink); color:var(--paper);}
  .nav-toggle{display:none; background:none; border:none; font-size:1.4rem; cursor:pointer; color:var(--ink);}
  @media (max-width:760px){
    .nav-links{
      position:absolute; top:100%; left:0; right:0; background:var(--paper);
      flex-direction:column; align-items:flex-start; gap:0;
      border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);
      max-height:0; overflow:hidden; transition:max-height .25s ease;
    }
    .nav-links.open{max-height:320px;}
    .nav-links a{padding:16px 20px; width:100%; border-top:1px solid var(--line);}
    .nav-cta{border:none; width:100%;}
    .nav-toggle{display:block;}
  }

  /* ---------- HERO ---------- */
  .hero{padding-top:88px; padding-bottom:96px;}
  .hero .wrap{display:grid; grid-template-columns:1.1fr 0.9fr; gap:60px; align-items:center;}
  @media (max-width:900px){ .hero .wrap{grid-template-columns:1fr;} }
  .hero h1{font-size:clamp(2.5rem, 4.4vw + 1rem, 4rem);}
  .hero-sub{margin-top:22px; max-width:46ch; font-size:1.1rem; color:var(--ink-soft);}
  .hero-actions{margin-top:36px; display:flex; gap:16px; flex-wrap:wrap;}
  .hero-note{margin-top:20px; font-family:var(--font-mono); font-size:0.82rem; color:var(--ink-soft);}

  .hero-art{position:relative; height:380px;}
  .swatch-card{
    position:absolute; top:0; right:6%; width:260px;
    background:var(--ink); color:var(--paper); border-radius:var(--radius-md);
    padding:20px; transform:rotate(4deg);
    box-shadow:0 24px 50px rgba(23,24,26,0.25);
  }
  .swatch-row{display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center; padding:10px 0; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(250,249,246,0.16); font-family:var(--font-mono); font-size:0.78rem;}
  .swatch-row:last-child{border-bottom:none;}
  .swatch-chip{width:22px; height:22px; border-radius:4px; flex-shrink:0;}
  .mark-card{
    position:absolute; bottom:6%; left:2%; width:150px; height:150px;
    background:var(--paper-mist); border-radius:var(--radius-md);
    display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;
    transform:rotate(-6deg); box-shadow:0 18px 40px rgba(23,24,26,0.14);
  }
  .mark{position:relative; width:70px; height:70px;}
  .mark span{position:absolute; display:block;}
  .mark .m-sq{width:36px; height:36px; background:var(--cobalt); top:0; left:0; border-radius:3px;}
  .mark .m-ci{width:34px; height:34px; background:var(--coral); border-radius:50%; bottom:0; right:0;}
  .mark .m-tr{width:0; height:0; border-left:17px solid transparent; border-right:17px solid transparent; border-bottom:30px solid var(--sunbeam); top:6px; right:6px;}
  .hero-art.animate .swatch-card{animation:dropIn .7s cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1) both;}
  .hero-art.animate .mark-card{animation:dropIn .7s .18s cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1) both;}
  @keyframes dropIn{
    from{opacity:0; transform:translateY(-24px) rotate(0deg);}
    to{opacity:1;}
  }

  /* ---------- SECTION HEADS ---------- */
  .section-head{max-width:56ch; margin-bottom:56px;}
  .section-head h2{font-size:clamp(1.9rem, 2.6vw + 1rem, 2.6rem);}
  .section-head p{margin-top:14px; color:var(--ink-soft); font-size:1.05rem;}
  .section-alt{background:var(--paper-mist);}

  /* ---------- SERVICES ---------- */
  .services-grid{display:grid; grid-template-columns:1.3fr 1fr 1fr; gap:24px;}
  @media (max-width:860px){ .services-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;} }
  .svc-card{border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:var(--radius-md); padding:32px; background:var(--paper);}
  .svc-card.feature{background:var(--ink); color:var(--paper); border-color:var(--ink);}
  .svc-card.feature .svc-from{color:var(--sunbeam);}
  .svc-card h3{font-size:1.4rem; margin-bottom:12px;}
  .svc-card p{color:var(--ink-soft); font-size:0.98rem;}
  .svc-card.feature p{color:rgba(250,249,246,0.8);}
  .svc-from{display:block; margin-top:20px; font-family:var(--font-mono); font-size:0.85rem; color:var(--cobalt-deep); font-weight:500;}

  /* ---------- WORK ---------- */
  .work-grid{display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr); gap:20px;}
  @media (max-width:860px){ .work-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;} }
  @media (max-width:560px){ .work-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;} }
  .work-card{border-radius:var(--radius-md); overflow:hidden; border:1px solid var(--line); background:var(--paper);}
  .work-card:nth-child(3n+1){grid-column:span 2;}
  @media (max-width:860px){ .work-card:nth-child(3n+1){grid-column:span 1;} }
  .work-art{height:170px; position:relative; overflow:hidden;}
  .work-art span{position:absolute; border-radius:50%;}
  .art-1{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#FF8A6B,var(--sunbeam));}
  .art-1 span{width:150px; height:150px; background:rgba(255,255,255,0.25); top:-40px; left:-30px;}
  .art-2{background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--cobalt),#8FA0FF);}
  .art-2 span{width:120px; height:120px; background:rgba(23,24,26,0.15); bottom:-30px; right:10px;}
  .art-3{background:repeating-linear-gradient(45deg, var(--ink), var(--ink) 12px, #2A2B2D 12px, #2A2B2D 24px);}
  .art-4{background:linear-gradient(160deg,#FFD79A,var(--coral));}
  .art-4 span{width:90px; height:90px; background:rgba(255,255,255,0.3); top:20px; right:30px;}
  .art-5{background:linear-gradient(200deg,var(--ink),#3A3B3E); }
  .art-5::before{content:""; position:absolute; inset:0; background:repeating-linear-gradient(115deg, rgba(255,200,61,0.5) 0 6px, transparent 6px 26px);}
  .art-6{background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--paper-mist),#D8D4C6);}
  .art-6 span{width:60px; height:60px; background:var(--cobalt); top:30px; left:30px; border-radius:6px;}
  .work-body{padding:18px 20px;}
  .work-body h3{font-size:1.05rem; font-weight:600; font-family:var(--font-body);}
  .work-meta{margin-top:6px; display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center;}
  .work-meta .tag{background:transparent; border:1px solid var(--line); padding:3px 9px; font-size:0.72rem;}
  .work-stat{font-family:var(--font-mono); font-size:0.78rem; color:var(--ink-soft);}

  /* ---------- PROCESS ---------- */
  .process-list{display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr); gap:0; border-top:1px solid var(--line);}
  @media (max-width:860px){ .process-list{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;} }
  @media (max-width:560px){ .process-list{grid-template-columns:1fr;} }
  .process-step{padding:28px 24px 28px 0; border-right:1px solid var(--line);}
  .process-list .process-step:last-child{border-right:none;}
  .process-num{font-family:var(--font-mono); color:var(--cobalt-deep); font-size:0.85rem;}
  .process-step h3{font-size:1.1rem; margin-top:10px; font-family:var(--font-body); font-weight:600;}
  .process-step p{margin-top:8px; font-size:0.93rem; color:var(--ink-soft);}

  /* ---------- CONCIERGE ---------- */
  .concierge-box{border:2px solid var(--ink); border-radius:var(--radius-md); padding:40px; display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; gap:36px;}
  @media (max-width:820px){ .concierge-box{grid-template-columns:1fr;} }
  .concierge-box textarea{
    width:100%; min-height:130px; padding:14px; border-radius:var(--radius-sm);
    border:1px solid var(--line); font-family:var(--font-body); font-size:0.98rem; resize:vertical;
  }
  .concierge-result{background:var(--paper-mist); border-radius:var(--radius-sm); padding:20px; min-height:130px;}
  .concierge-result .placeholder{color:var(--ink-soft); font-size:0.92rem;}
  .concierge-result .rec-pkg{font-family:var(--font-mono); font-size:0.8rem; color:var(--cobalt-deep); margin-bottom:6px;}
  .concierge-result h4{font-family:var(--font-body); font-size:1.15rem; font-weight:600; margin-bottom:8px;}
  .concierge-result p{font-size:0.92rem; color:var(--ink-soft); margin-top:6px;}
  .spinner{width:18px; height:18px; border-radius:50%; border:3px solid var(--line); border-top-color:var(--cobalt); animation:spin .7s linear infinite; display:inline-block;}
  @keyframes spin{to{transform:rotate(360deg);}}

  /* ---------- PRICING ---------- */
  .pricing-grid{display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr); gap:24px;}
  @media (max-width:860px){ .pricing-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;} }
  .price-card{border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:var(--radius-md); padding:32px; display:flex; flex-direction:column;}
  .price-card.highlight{background:var(--ink); color:var(--paper); border-color:var(--ink); transform:translateY(-10px);}
  @media (max-width:860px){ .price-card.highlight{transform:none;} }
  .price-card .note{font-size:0.82rem; color:var(--coral); margin-top:4px; font-weight:600;}
  .price-card.highlight .note{color:var(--sunbeam);}
  .price-amount{font-family:var(--font-display); font-size:2.1rem; font-weight:800; margin:18px 0 4px;}
  .price-card ul{list-style:none; margin:22px 0; padding:0; flex-grow:1;}
  .price-card li{padding:8px 0; border-top:1px solid var(--line); font-size:0.93rem; display:flex; gap:10px;}
  .price-card.highlight li{border-top:1px solid rgba(250,249,246,0.16);}
  .price-card li::before{content:"▪"; color:var(--cobalt-deep); flex-shrink:0;}
  .price-card.highlight li::before{color:var(--sunbeam);}
  .price-card .btn{width:100%; justify-content:center;}
  .price-card.highlight .btn-ghost{border-color:var(--paper); color:var(--paper);}
  .price-card.highlight .btn-ghost:hover{background:var(--paper); color:var(--ink);}

  /* ---------- BOOKING ---------- */
  .book-grid{display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; gap:56px;}
  @media (max-width:900px){ .book-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;} }
  .day-scroller{display:flex; gap:10px; overflow-x:auto; padding-bottom:8px;}
  .day-pill{
    flex-shrink:0; width:64px; padding:12px 0; text-align:center; border:1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius:var(--radius-sm); cursor:pointer; background:var(--paper); font-family:var(--font-mono);
  }
  .day-pill .dow{display:block; font-size:0.7rem; color:var(--ink-soft);}
  .day-pill .dom{display:block; font-size:1.15rem; font-weight:600; margin-top:2px;}
  .day-pill:hover{border-color:var(--ink);}
  .day-pill.selected{background:var(--ink); color:var(--paper); border-color:var(--ink);}
  .day-pill.selected .dow{color:rgba(250,249,246,0.7);}
  .slot-grid{display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr); gap:10px; margin-top:20px;}
  .slot-btn{
    padding:12px 6px; border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:var(--radius-sm);
    background:var(--paper); font-family:var(--font-mono); font-size:0.85rem; cursor:pointer;
  }
  .slot-btn:hover:not(:disabled){border-color:var(--ink);}
  .slot-btn.selected{background:var(--cobalt); border-color:var(--cobalt); color:var(--paper);}
  .slot-btn:disabled{opacity:0.35; text-decoration:line-through; cursor:not-allowed;}
  .field{margin-bottom:18px;}
  .field label{display:block; font-size:0.85rem; font-weight:600; margin-bottom:6px;}
  .field input, .field select, .field textarea{
    width:100%; padding:12px 14px; border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:var(--radius-sm);
    font-family:var(--font-body); font-size:0.98rem; background:var(--paper);
  }
  .field textarea{min-height:90px; resize:vertical;}
  .booking-summary{font-family:var(--font-mono); font-size:0.85rem; background:var(--paper-mist); padding:14px 16px; border-radius:var(--radius-sm); margin-bottom:18px; display:none;}
  .booking-summary.show{display:block;}
  .form-msg{margin-top:14px; font-size:0.9rem;}
  .form-msg.error{color:var(--coral); font-weight:600;}
  .confirm-box{display:none; text-align:center; padding:40px 20px;}
  .confirm-box.show{display:block;}
  .confirm-box h3{font-size:1.6rem;}
  .confirm-box p{margin-top:12px; color:var(--ink-soft);}

  /* ---------- TESTIMONIALS ---------- */
  .testi-grid{display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr); gap:24px;}
  @media (max-width:860px){ .testi-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;} }
  .testi-card{padding:28px; border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:var(--radius-md);}
  .testi-mark{font-family:var(--font-display); font-size:2.4rem; color:var(--cobalt); line-height:1; display:block; margin-bottom:6px;}
  .testi-card p.quote{font-size:1rem; color:var(--ink);}
  .testi-who{margin-top:16px; font-family:var(--font-mono); font-size:0.8rem; color:var(--ink-soft);}

  /* ---------- FOOTER ---------- */
  footer{border-top:1px solid var(--line); padding:48px 0;}
  .footer-inner{display:flex; justify-content:space-between; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:20px; align-items:center;}
  .footer-links{display:flex; gap:22px; font-size:0.88rem;}
  .footer-links a{text-decoration:none;}
  .footer-links a:hover{color:var(--cobalt-deep);}
  .copyright{font-family:var(--font-mono); font-size:0.78rem; color:var(--ink-soft);}

  /* ---------- ADMIN MODAL ---------- */
  .modal-backdrop{
    display:none; position:fixed; inset:0; background:rgba(23,24,26,0.55); z-index:100;
    align-items:center; justify-content:center; padding:20px;
  }
  .modal-backdrop.show{display:flex;}
  .modal{background:var(--paper); border-radius:var(--radius-md); max-width:640px; width:100%; max-height:82vh; overflow-y:auto; padding:32px;}
  .modal h3{font-size:1.4rem;}
  .modal .disclaimer{font-size:0.82rem; color:var(--coral); margin-top:10px; font-weight:600;}
  .modal-close{float:right; background:none; border:none; font-size:1.3rem; cursor:pointer;}
  .booking-row{border-top:1px solid var(--line); padding:14px 0; font-size:0.88rem;}
  .booking-row strong{font-family:var(--font-mono);}
  .booking-row button{margin-top:8px; font-size:0.78rem; padding:6px 12px;}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<!-- ============ NAV ============ -->
<header class="site-nav">
  <div class="nav-inner">
    <a class="brand" href="#top">Hasbal Digital Creative Studio</a>
    <nav class="nav-links" id="navLinks">
      <a href="#work">Work</a>
      <a href="#services">Services</a>
      <a href="#process">Process</a>
      <a href="#pricing">Pricing</a>
      <a href="#book" class="nav-cta">Book a session</a>
    </nav>
    <button class="nav-toggle" id="navToggle" aria-label="Toggle menu" aria-expanded="false">☰</button>
  </div>
</header>

<!-- ============ HERO ============ -->
<section class="hero" id="top">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="hero-copy">
      <h1>Thoughtful design, delivered on a real timeline.</h1>
      <p class="hero-sub">I'm <strong>[Your Name]</strong>, a freelance graphic designer helping small businesses and founders build brands, sites, and print work that actually ships. Pick a service, see a package, book a time — done.</p>
      <div class="hero-actions">
        <a href="#book" class="btn btn-primary">Book a session</a>
        <a href="#work" class="btn btn-ghost">See the work</a>
      </div>
      <p class="hero-note">Currently booking projects for late 2026.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-art" id="heroArt">
      <div class="swatch-card">
        <div class="swatch-row"><span>Cobalt</span><span class="swatch-chip" style="background:#2F3EFF"></span></div>
        <div class="swatch-row"><span>Coral</span><span class="swatch-chip" style="background:#FF5A5F"></span></div>
        <div class="swatch-row"><span>Sunbeam</span><span class="swatch-chip" style="background:#FFC83D"></span></div>
        <div class="swatch-row"><span>Ink</span><span class="swatch-chip" style="background:#17181A"></span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="mark-card">
        <div class="mark">
          <span class="m-tr"></span>
          <span class="m-sq"></span>
          <span class="m-ci"></span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============ SERVICES ============ -->
<section id="services">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head">
      <h2>Three ways to work together</h2>
      <p>Pick the scope that matches where your project actually is — not a menu of forty add-ons.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="services-grid">
      <div class="svc-card feature">
        <h3>Brand identity</h3>
        <p>Logo, color system, typography, and a guideline doc your team can actually follow. For new businesses or overdue rebrands.</p>
        <span class="svc-from">From $1,200</span>
      </div>
      <div class="svc-card">
        <h3>Web &amp; digital design</h3>
        <p>Landing pages, UI kits, and social templates that match your brand and load fast.</p>
        <span class="svc-from">From $900</span>
      </div>
      <div class="svc-card">
        <h3>Print &amp; packaging</h3>
        <p>Packaging, editorial layouts, signage, and other things people hold in their hands.</p>
        <span class="svc-from">From $700</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============ WORK ============ -->
<section id="work" class="section-alt">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head">
      <h2>Recent work</h2>
      <p>A sample of past projects. Swap these for your own case studies before publishing.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="work-grid">
      <div class="work-card">
        <div class="work-art art-1"><span></span></div>
        <div class="work-body">
          <h3>Citrus Collective</h3>
          <div class="work-meta"><span class="tag">Branding</span><span class="work-stat">Full identity, 2026</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="work-card">
        <div class="work-art art-2"><span></span></div>
        <div class="work-body">
          <h3>Nordholm Coffee</h3>
